{
  "sn51.11:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 51.11 ",
  "sn51.11:0.2": "2. Pāsādakampanavagga ",
  "sn51.11:0.3": "Pubbasutta ",
  "sn51.11:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn51.11:1.2": "“Pubbeva me, bhikkhave, sambodhā anabhisambuddhassa bodhisattasseva sato etadahosi: ",
  "sn51.11:1.3": "‘ko nu kho hetu, ko paccayo iddhipādabhāvanāyā’ti? ",
  "sn51.11:1.4": "Tassa mayhaṁ, bhikkhave, etadahosi: ",
  "sn51.11:1.5": "‘idha bhikkhu chandasamādhippadhānasaṅkhārasamannāgataṁ iddhipādaṁ bhāveti—",
  "sn51.11:1.6": "iti me chando na ca atilīno bhavissati, na ca atippaggahito bhavissati, na ca ajjhattaṁ saṅkhitto bhavissati, na ca bahiddhā vikkhitto bhavissati. ",
  "sn51.11:1.7": "Pacchāpuresaññī ca viharati—",
  "sn51.11:1.8": "yathā pure tathā pacchā, yathā pacchā tathā pure; ",
  "sn51.11:1.9": "yathā adho tathā uddhaṁ, yathā uddhaṁ tathā adho; ",
  "sn51.11:1.10": "yathā divā tathā rattiṁ, yathā rattiṁ tathā divā. ",
  "sn51.11:1.11": "Iti vivaṭena cetasā apariyonaddhena sappabhāsaṁ cittaṁ bhāveti’. ",
  "sn51.11:2.1": "Vīriyasamādhippadhānasaṅkhārasamannāgataṁ iddhipādaṁ bhāveti—",
  "sn51.11:2.2": "iti me vīriyaṁ na ca atilīnaṁ bhavissati, na ca atippaggahitaṁ bhavissati, na ca ajjhattaṁ saṅkhittaṁ bhavissati, na ca bahiddhā vikkhittaṁ bhavissati. ",
  "sn51.11:2.3": "Pacchāpuresaññī ca viharati—",
  "sn51.11:2.4": "yathā pure tathā pacchā, yathā pacchā tathā pure; ",
  "sn51.11:2.5": "yathā a